Package: DYNAMIC.IV
Title: DYNAMIC-IV
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Wei", "Hong", , "wei.hong@hongconsulting.ai", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Sample size simulator for DYNAMIC-IV cohort A. This version calls 
    the original 'BuyseTest' package via the 'Rcpp' interface. 'WH' code is 
    otherwise designed to maximize speed, for use in simulation studies. As 
	such, input validation is minimal and the user is responsible for ensuring 
	valid use.
